{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2023-01-30 17:29:00', 'title': 'BETTERINVESTING™ MAGAZINE UPDATE ON LULULEMON ATHLETICA INC. AND WALGREENS BOOTS ALLIANCE, INC.', 'text': 'TROY, MICH. , JAN. 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE EDITORIAL ADVISORY AND SECURITIES REVIEW COMMITTEE OF BETTERINVESTING MAGAZINE TODAY ANNOUNCED LULULEMON ATHLETICA INC. (NASDAQ: LULU) AS ITS "STOCK TO STUDY" AND WALGREENS BOOTS ALLIANCE INC. (NASDAQ: WBA) AS ITS "UNDERVALUED STOCK" IN THE APRIL 2023 ISSUE FOR INVESTORS\' INFORMATIONAL AND EDUCATIONAL USE.'}